## Getting Started

```bash
# Build backend
cd backend/{{archetypeCategory}}
./mvnw quarkus:dev

{{#if project.features.frontend}}
{{#if (eq project.frontend.platform "both")}}
# Start web frontend (separate terminal)
cd frontend/web-app
npm install
npm run dev

# Start mobile app (separate terminal)
cd frontend/mobile-app
npm install
npx expo start
{{else if (eq project.frontend.platform "mobile")}}
# Start mobile app (separate terminal)
cd frontend/mobile-app
npm install
npx expo start
{{else}}
# Start frontend (separate terminal)
cd frontend/web-app
npm install
npm run dev
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
```

